cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this compiled inventory, cite the v2 repository snapshot and the
  original source datasets listed in sources.csv. This derivative does not
  replace source-specific citations or licenses.
title: "Rwanda Landslide Inventory v2"
type: dataset
version: "2.0.0"
date-released: 2026-10-17
abstract: >-
  Audited and expanded compilation of reported Rwanda landslide episodes and
  mapped source contexts, with source-row reconciliation, administrative
  overlays, DEM slope screening and explicit uncertainty notes. Counts are
  reporting counts, not normalized risk; mapped geometries include a combined
  landslide/flash-flood inventory that is not classified per feature.
repository-code: https://github.com/theoneste2060/rwanda_landslide_inventory
keywords:
  - Rwanda
  - landslide
  - inventory
  - geospatial
  - disaster records
license: other
